{"title":"Career Roadmap · Cardiac Imaging Technician","role":"Cardiac Imaging Technician","summary":"A Cardiac Imaging Technician supports cardiac diagnostic and interventional procedures that use medical imaging and physiological monitoring to visualize the heart and blood vessels.","facts":{"Current degree":"Allied Health Sciences (B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.)","Course":"Cath Lab / Interventional Cardiology Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Cardiac Imaging Technician supports cardiac diagnostic and interventional procedures that use medical imaging and physiological monitoring to visualize the heart and blood vessels."},{"type":"p","text":"In a Cath Lab / Interventional Cardiology Technology pathway, the professional may work with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiac catheterization"},{"type":"h","text":"Coronary angiography"},{"type":"h","text":"Fluoroscopy"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital subtraction angiography"},{"type":"h","text":"Hemodynamic monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Interventional cardiology procedures"},{"type":"h","text":"Peripheral vascular procedures"},{"type":"h","text":"Structural heart procedures"},{"type":"h","text":"Electrophysiology procedures"},{"type":"h","text":"Image-guided interventions"},{"type":"p","text":"The role is multidisciplinary and involves close coordination with interventional cardiologists, cardiologists, nurses, radiographers/radiologic technologists, cardiovascular technologists, medical physicists, and other healthcare professionals."},{"type":"note","label":"Qualification and scope note","text":"“Cardiac Imaging Technician” is not a universally standardized professional title. A generic B.Sc/BPT/BOT/BMLT degree does not automatically qualify someone to independently operate cath-lab imaging systems. Students targeting this career should pursue recognized cardiovascular/cath-lab/radiology training and supervised clinical experience appropriate to the employer and applicable regulations."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"UG / Recognized Cardiovascular or Cath-Lab Technology Education"},{"type":"flow","items":["Anatomy","Physiology","Cardiology Fundamentals"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiation Physics + Medical Imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Cath-Lab Equipment Training"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiac Imaging / Cath-Lab Technician"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Cardiac Imaging Technologist"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized Interventional Imaging Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior / Supervisory / Applications Role"},{"type":"h","text":"Management / Research / Advanced Cardiac Technology"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Anatomy, physiology and basic cardiac science"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Cardiology, imaging and radiation fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Cath-lab equipment and procedure workflows"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Clinical internship and specialization"}],[{"text":"Entry Level"},{"text":"Imaging and procedure support"}],[{"text":"Experienced"},{"text":"Advanced cath-lab and interventional procedures"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Quality, safety and team coordination"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Applications, management, research or technology"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build the Cardiovascular Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Human anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"Human physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection prevention"},{"ty