ata recording"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical applications"},{"type":"p","text":"Interpretation of findings remains a clinical responsibility."}]},{"heading":"Contrast Media Safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Contrast-media basics"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient allergy history"},{"type":"h","text":"Renal-risk considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Contrast administration systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Extravasation awareness"},{"type":"h","text":"Contrast reaction recognition"},{"type":"h","text":"Potential reactions include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Mild allergic-type reactions"},{"type":"h","text":"Nausea"},{"type":"h","text":"Urticaria"},{"type":"h","text":"Bronchospasm"},{"type":"h","text":"Hypotension"},{"type":"h","text":"Severe hypersensitivity reactions"},{"type":"p","text":"The technician should recognize and immediately escalate concerning reactions according to the department's emergency protocol."}]},{"heading":"Radiation Safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Cath-lab professionals work around ionizing radiation."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Principles"},{"type":"h","text":"ALARA"},{"type":"h","text":"(As Low As Reasonably Achievable)"},{"type":"h","text":"Minimize Time"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Maximize Distance"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Use Shielding"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Optimize Imaging Parameters"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn appropriate use of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead aprons"},{"type":"h","text":"Thyroid shields"},{"type":"h","text":"Protective barriers"},{"type":"h","text":"Ceiling-mounted shields"},{"type":"h","text":"Table-side shields"},{"type":"h","text":"Personal dosimeters"},{"type":"h","text":"Also understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Radiation dose"},{"type":"h","text":"Scatter radiation"},{"type":"h","text":"Dose-area product"},{"type":"h","text":"Fluoroscopy time"},{"type":"h","text":"Dose optimization"},{"type":"h","tex